    "current_changed_and_new_sources": "execution.py including final redacted_create_error, preflight.py snake_case change, complete workflow, tests/test_omni_execution.py, attempt_inspection.py, reconcile_failed_probe.py, tests/test_omni_probe_reconciliation.py and failed-probe-attempt-v1.json were read in full.",
